# VinaX AI artifact runner (sandbox.vinaxmusic.online). See DEPLOYMENT.md "VinaX AI sandbox".
# Its own origin, so nothing an artifact runs can reach the app, its storage or its session.
# Model-written code runs here: scripts only from cdnjs, jsDelivr and unpkg (three.js
# r160's ES modules and addons live on jsDelivr; 2026-11-18); the only fetches allowed are
# files on jsDelivr and unpkg (three's example models, textures and an HDR sky from the
# jsDelivr GitHub mirror, Draco decoders) and blob: / data: URLs the page makes itself
# (three's model loader reads a .glb's embedded textures that way), never the app, its API or anywhere else;
# framed only by VinaX itself.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://unpkg.com; worker-src blob:; style-src 'unsafe-inline' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://unpkg.com; img-src data: blob: https:; font-src data: https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://unpkg.com; media-src data: blob: https:; connect-src https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://unpkg.com blob: data:; frame-src 'self' blob: data:; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors https://www.vinaxmusic.online http://localhost:*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
